keywords:
  - stochastic partial differential equations
  - Allen–Cahn equation
  - Fourier spectral methods
  - exponential integrators
  - JAX
abstract: >-
  exponax-spde implements Fourier spectral time steppers for stochastic
  partial differential equations in JAX, including stochastic Allen–Cahn
  dynamics with additive or multiplicative noise.
  The package provides coupled noise increments, ensemble statistics and
  reproducible diagnostics for assessing numerical accuracy.
